Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.77,0:00:06.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(春藥束縛潛入搜查官7)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.12,0:02:07.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在找什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.82,0:02:13.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和你無關吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.82,0:02:16.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快點說
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:19.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,會更好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.42,0:02:33.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很厲害能忍住呢 這個呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.17,0:02:45.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-住手  -威力不錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.97,0:03:14.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了嗎 你在找什麼 說
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.37,0:03:20.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.52,0:03:35.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:41.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,會死的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.67,0:03:54.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撐住了嗎 很厲害呢\N這個如何
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.97,0:04:14.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣 舒服嗎 或者說
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.12,0:04:43.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手啊 住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.77,0:04:51.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:09.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.12,0:05:47.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厲害 拷問都撐住了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.87,0:05:50.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了不起呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.52,0:06:30.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是有效果了呢 這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.07,0:06:44.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摧毀你哦 說不說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.32,0:07:20.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很興奮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.72,0:07:25.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好非常好 你的精神
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.12,0:07:32.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是不說嗎 好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.57,0:07:41.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來我們這裡工作嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.12,0:07:53.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想來嗎 真的有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.07,0:07:58.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.22,0:08:01.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.22,0:08:04.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要這樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.02,0:08:12.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,會怎麼樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.62,0:08:23.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.77,0:08:47.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做我們的同伴嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.67,0:09:12.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽到了嗎 更緊了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.57,0:09:32.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還有意識嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:54.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.47,0:10:07.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要摧毀你了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.82,0:10:28.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高潮了高潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:45.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昏迷了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.17,0:11:06.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別這樣看我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.17,0:11:09.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃飯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.97,0:16:34.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣想加入我們了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.97,0:16:39.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能的 這是什麼衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.77,0:16:42.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很適合你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.17,0:16:47.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做什麼 快點放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.57,0:16:53.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對了這個真好看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.17,0:17:03.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繼續繼續吧 讓你身體舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.27,0:17:14.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.17,0:17:21.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手吧 住手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.17,0:17:25.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,藥物的效果還在吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.17,0:17:35.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.27,0:17:41.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別動 不然很厲害的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.92,0:17:51.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放開我 住手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.62,0:17:54.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.97,0:18:02.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.27,0:18:07.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,發出聲音了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.12,0:18:14.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其實非常舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.67,0:19:04.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,發抖了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.67,0:19:17.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-想讓我弄這裡吧\N-那裡不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.22,0:19:28.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繼續繼續
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:35.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-還有想被弄的地方吧\N-住手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.57,0:19:40.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放開我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.77,0:20:02.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下面更舒服的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.57,0:20:05.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.57,0:20:18.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不要不要  -怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.17,0:20:21.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.62,0:20:46.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常興奮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.72,0:21:16.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.22,0:21:20.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才剛開始呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.57,0:21:44.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手住手啊 住手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.02,0:21:47.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.82,0:22:05.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小穴要壞掉了?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.72,0:22:11.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高潮吧 我想聽你說出來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.37,0:22:20.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然後才停下哦\N說你小穴要壞了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.72,0:22:34.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高潮了高潮了高潮了高潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.67,0:22:38.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繼續舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.52,0:22:46.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我聽不到 大聲點
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.82,0:22:52.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什麼  -小穴受不了了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.87,0:23:11.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小穴高潮了就停止哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.27,0:23:35.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要插入嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.42,0:23:42.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-住手住手\N-那麼繼續玩弄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.82,0:23:46.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣子弄
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.12,0:23:49.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常喜歡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.97,0:23:54.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好疼好疼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.92,0:23:58.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.72,0:24:06.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我聽不到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.97,0:25:28.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝酒雞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.42,0:25:40.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-謝謝  -沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.72,0:25:51.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好 美女一起喝嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.77,0:25:56.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-乾杯  -乾杯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.62,0:26:01.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.52,0:26:09.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你的名字是什麼  -真奈
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.77,0:26:14.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真奈你好 初次見面
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.77,0:26:17.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一個人來的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.67,0:26:23.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-一個人來的  -好看不
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.02,0:26:26.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很好看
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.72,0:26:31.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很難得
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.47,0:26:37.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起去那邊喝酒吧
