Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.97,0:26:58.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好喝吧  -非常好喝
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.67,0:27:02.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎麼了  -乾杯
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.27,0:27:06.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.62,0:27:10.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真性感啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.42,0:27:14.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,討厭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.72,0:27:22.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-喝多了吧  -身材真好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.52,0:27:29.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-多喝點多喝點  -乾杯 好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.07,0:27:37.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個很大呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.67,0:27:41.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.77,0:27:50.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我喝多了\N-沒關係的 沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.72,0:27:53.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道喝了多少了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.87,0:27:57.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很開心
