Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.82,0:28:20.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好喝
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.42,0:28:24.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-沒事吧  -沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.62,0:28:32.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常可愛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.57,0:28:37.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有點喝多了  -繼續喝酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.97,0:28:45.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我回去了  -等一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.92,0:28:51.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一共多少錢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.92,0:28:55.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,30萬
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.82,0:29:02.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-30萬  -是不是弄錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.87,0:29:09.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-喝酒了要30萬  -沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.67,0:29:13.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.67,0:29:18.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不用那麼多  -快點
